# What EAS Build does not need from the monorepo: the site, the backend
# notes, the authored content (the app reads it from the published site)
# and, above all, the private plaque codes and image originals, which must
# never leave the repository. node_modules and .git are skipped by EAS
# itself. Dotfiles and generated native projects are not needed either:
# EAS runs prebuild on the worker.
apps/web
supabase
scripts
packages/content/public
packages/content/private
apps/mobile/art
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/.expo
apps/mobile/.env*
